==Serbo-Croatian==

===Etymology===
From {{etyl|sla-pro|sh}} {{term/t|sla-pro|*jebati}}, from {{etyl|ine-pro|sh}} {{term/t|ine-pro|*h₃yebʰ-}}. Cognate with Ancient Greek {{term|οἴφω|tr=oíphō|lang=grc}}, Sanskrit {{term|यभति|tr=yabhati|lang=sa}}.

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|/jěbati/|lang=sh}}
* {{hyphenation|је|ба|ти|lang=sh}}

===Verb===
{{sh-verb|head=јѐбати|c|jebati|jèbati}} {{impf}}

# {{context|transitive|vulgar|lang=sh}} to [[fuck]]
#: {{usex|јебао сам је ц(иј)ело љето/лето|t=I was fucking her for the whole summer|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|јебао сам је дивље у гузу све до зоре|t=I kept fucking her in the ass until dawn|lang=sh|inline=1}}
# {{context|reflexive|vulgar|lang=sh}} to have [[sexual]] [[relationship]]s with somebody
#: {{usex|јебемо се као зечеви кад год стигнемо|t=we fuck like rabbits whenever we can|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|њих двоје се јебу|t=the two of them are having [regular] sex|lang=sh|inline=1}}
# {{context|transitive|vulgar|figuratively|lang=sh}} to [[bother]], [[pest]], [[annoy]]
#: {{usex|немој ме јебати више!|t=stop fucking with me!|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|ц(иј)ело вр(иј)еме док сам возио јебао ме са својим срањима|t=all the way while I was driving he was bothering me with his shit|lang=sh|inline=1}}
# {{context|transitive|vulgar|figuratively|lang=sh}} not to [[pay attention]], not to [[give a flying fuck]]
#: {{usex|ја јој причам а она ме не јебе|t=I keep talking to her and she doesn't give a fuck|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|не јебе ме ни 2 посто!|t=[he/she] doesn't give a flying fuck about me|lang=sh|inline=1}}
# {{non-gloss definition|figurative and idiomatic senses}}
#: {{usex|јеби га!|t=fuck it!|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|нек се јебе|t=he/she can go fuck himself/herself|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|(т)ко те јебе!|t=who gives a shit about you!|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|ни(т)ко те не јебе|t=nobody gives a shit about you|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|можеш га/се јебати|t=there is nothing you can do|lang=sh|inline=1}}
#: {{usex|јебе ми се|t=I don't give a crap|lang=sh|inline=1}}

